Subject: [PATCH 05/12] Android: add XD Netplay launcher home screen

New launcher entry point: readiness checklist (XD ISO in the game
list, Emerald ROM configured, bundled BIOS/rules), buttons into the
netplay setup flow and the team editor, and escape hatches to full
Dolphin and settings. The team editor screen is a placeholder for the
Gen 3 save editor that lands next.
